      "beat_id": "B02",
      "act": "FRAMEWORK",
      "narration_text": "Physics Volume One is its own app, seventeen chapters with simulations embedded in the pages. There are four kinds. The Projectile Explorer takes a launch angle, a speed and gravity, then draws the path and marks the peak and range. The others show circular motion vectors, plotted functions, and motion split into x and y.",
